WEBVTT

00:09.110 --> 00:13.490
The soldiers had their lives squeezed
out of them like fruit being juiced...

00:14.110 --> 00:15.760
...and their scraps cast into the sea.

00:24.920 --> 00:28.130
I suppose I should
explain what the sea is.

00:29.880 --> 00:34.950
The sea is a body of salt water that
covers 70% of our world's surface.

02:05.980 --> 02:10.980
"Attack Titan"

02:11.691 --> 02:14.891
Sync and corrections by masaca
- addic7ed.com -

02:25.200 --> 02:27.330
Owl... Who are you?

02:30.460 --> 02:32.499
I am Eren Kruger.

02:32.500 --> 02:36.420
As you just saw, I possess
one of the Nine Titans.

02:37.090 --> 02:40.190
In other words, I'm a Subject
of Ymir, just like you.

02:41.760 --> 02:45.430
You pretended to be a Marleyan
and infiltrated Public Security?

02:45.930 --> 02:47.430
What about the blood tests?!

02:47.640 --> 02:50.690
That was easy enough with
the help of a doctor.

02:51.310 --> 02:53.290
Doctors make good spies.

02:53.810 --> 02:56.190
In all honesty, you did very well.

02:57.030 --> 03:00.970
But in terms of results, Grice had
every right to grieve like he did.

03:03.070 --> 03:04.620
You're absolutely right...

03:05.450 --> 03:10.350
I was a useless father, a useless
husband, and a useless man.

03:11.580 --> 03:15.940
And yet, why am I the only one
who remains as a human?

03:19.720 --> 03:24.000
Dina was someone special, being a
Subject of Ymir with royal blood.

03:24.850 --> 03:26.540
She can tap into a Titan's true power.

03:27.260 --> 03:30.640
If you hadn't jumped to keep
me quiet, Dina would...

03:33.310 --> 03:35.940
Answer me!
Why did you let only me live?!

03:37.980 --> 03:40.360
Enough. Don't your fingers hurt?

03:41.070 --> 03:43.199
Thanks so much for your concern!

03:43.200 --> 03:46.570
You didn't seem to care so much
when you were chopping them off!

03:48.040 --> 03:51.369
Well?! If you had gone on a rampage
as your Titan sooner,

03:51.370 --> 03:53.790
wouldn't the others not
be Titans right now?!

03:54.000 --> 03:57.020
What was the whole point of
letting them become Titans?!

04:00.670 --> 04:02.680
What's wrong? You look pale...

04:05.090 --> 04:07.680
It wasn't just fellow patriots...

04:08.390 --> 04:11.850
I've severed thousands of fingers
from Subjects of Ymir...

04:12.310 --> 04:14.160
...and made them into Titans.

04:15.310 --> 04:17.190
Women and children, too...

04:19.110 --> 04:22.190
All while believing it was
for the sake of Eldia.

04:25.200 --> 04:27.380
I don't have much time, Grisha.

04:27.780 --> 04:30.060
I'm entrusting you with the final task.

04:30.410 --> 04:33.120
Not anyone else. Just you.

04:41.550 --> 04:44.820
That day... The day I first met you,

04:45.590 --> 04:47.300
if none of that had happened,

04:47.890 --> 04:52.290
you wouldn't have festered enough
hatred of Marley to come this far.

04:53.180 --> 04:56.560
Is that... the reason you chose me?

04:57.900 --> 04:59.060
That's part of it.

05:00.570 --> 05:03.710
The country...
Your father... Yourself...

05:04.190 --> 05:09.330
The hate in your eyes was enough
to burn the world to ashes.

05:10.530 --> 05:12.560
I was once like that, too...

05:13.910 --> 05:17.619
The royal family that stayed
behind formed a revolution.

05:17.620 --> 05:19.770
My father was part of it.

05:20.920 --> 05:24.220
However, they accomplished
nothing at all...

05:24.630 --> 05:26.590
...and were burned alive.

05:27.180 --> 05:32.640
I was so young, all I could do was peek
through the closet door and watch.

05:33.350 --> 05:38.650
Ever since then, I've sworn revenge
on Marley and the revival of Eldia.

05:39.940 --> 05:44.649
But all I've managed to do is cut
the fingers off my fellow patriots,

05:44.650 --> 05:47.980
kick them off this wall,
and turn them into Titans.

05:48.530 --> 05:53.590
It's because of the things I've done that
my true identity was never discovered.

05:55.200 --> 05:57.829
I'm no different than when I was little.

05:57.830 --> 06:01.820
Perhaps I'm still looking at the world
through a crack from the closet.

06:05.840 --> 06:08.020
Tell me, Owl.

06:09.090 --> 06:11.470
What is this task left for me?

06:14.310 --> 06:18.480
It's to infiltrate the walls and
retake the Founding Titan.

06:19.270 --> 06:21.480
After you inherit my Titan, that is.

06:23.650 --> 06:24.620
What did you say?

06:25.150 --> 06:27.069
That would mean... you...

06:27.070 --> 06:29.280
I'll be eaten by you as a Titan.

06:30.070 --> 06:33.310
You'll take the Founding Titan
from its owner the same way.

06:34.080 --> 06:35.450
Why aren't you doing it?

06:38.120 --> 06:42.580
Those who inherit the power of
the Nine Titans perish in 13 years.

06:43.420 --> 06:46.450
I inherited this power 13 years ago.

06:47.090 --> 06:50.260
The Owl called it "The Curse of Ymir."

06:51.090 --> 06:55.009
The founder Ymir lived that long
after her powers awakened,

06:55.010 --> 06:57.970
so it's only appropriate
we live that long, too.

06:59.020 --> 07:00.940
I've got 13 years left...

07:01.690 --> 07:02.590
And you...

07:03.310 --> 07:05.899
Eight years left... Not even.

07:05.900 --> 07:06.730
You're wrong.

07:08.110 --> 07:10.680
This has to be... a mistake.

07:14.410 --> 07:15.530
It's wrong.

07:20.370 --> 07:25.630
If one possessing the power of the
Nine Titans dies without passing it on,

07:26.250 --> 07:32.200
the power is inherited by a baby
yet to be born by a Subject of Ymir.

07:32.970 --> 07:39.140
It's as if all the Subjects of Ymir are
connected by something we can't see.

07:39.890 --> 07:42.640
One inheritor said they saw paths.

07:43.440 --> 07:45.870
The blood and bones that form a Titan,

07:46.320 --> 07:50.280
and at times, even memories and
thoughts are sent through those paths.

07:51.280 --> 07:55.240
All the paths cross at
a single coordinate.

07:56.030 --> 07:58.000
In other words, that's...

07:58.740 --> 08:00.340
...the Founding Titan.

08:03.580 --> 08:08.020
Every single Subject of Ymir
is connected to that coordinate.

08:08.840 --> 08:11.670
Who was the founder Ymir exactly?

08:12.930 --> 08:15.620
Under Marley authority,
she's a pawn of the devil.

08:16.180 --> 08:19.850
During the Eldian Empire era,
she was a miracle of God.

08:21.060 --> 08:24.349
Some say she touched the
source of all living matter.

08:24.350 --> 08:26.309
Who's to say they're wrong?

08:26.310 --> 08:26.860
Huh?

08:27.270 --> 08:30.700
The only truth in this world
is that there is no truth.

08:31.490 --> 08:34.150
Anyone can become a god or a devil.

08:34.990 --> 08:37.850
All it takes is for
people to believe it.

08:38.990 --> 08:42.659
You're the one who said that
Dina had royal blood in her.

08:42.660 --> 08:44.460
Was that a "truth" of yours?

08:45.460 --> 08:49.839
Unfortunately, Dina having
royal blood was true.

08:49.840 --> 08:51.300
Then why abandon her?

08:51.800 --> 08:56.800
Precisely because she had royal blood.
I couldn't let the enemy have her.

08:57.140 --> 09:00.050
It had to be done before Zeke
told Marley everything.

09:01.060 --> 09:02.060
Even so...

09:02.140 --> 09:03.250
Even so?

09:03.930 --> 09:09.290
Would she be better off giving birth to
children for the enemy her entire life?

09:10.980 --> 09:14.450
I've done my duty. You do yours.

09:15.320 --> 09:21.090
Only someone with the power of the
Titans is capable of reaching the walls.

09:22.080 --> 09:25.959
To be perfectly honest,
I don't think I'm fit for the job.

09:25.960 --> 09:27.480
You will do it.

09:29.040 --> 09:30.460
Look at that...

09:31.550 --> 09:33.960
He was eaten alive by a Titan.

09:34.920 --> 09:38.290
And you asked if watching
that was interesting?

09:39.300 --> 09:41.349
It wasn't interesting at all.

09:41.350 --> 09:44.590
His screams of agony
were unbearable to hear.

09:46.190 --> 09:49.440
I... didn't know any better.

09:50.310 --> 09:54.750
If I had known this was the price
of freedom, I wouldn't have paid it.

10:00.200 --> 10:00.950
Stand.

10:01.660 --> 10:02.680
Fight!

10:04.830 --> 10:07.980
For the sake of restoring
freedom and dignity to Eldia...

10:08.580 --> 10:09.260
Stand!

10:10.210 --> 10:11.250
I...

10:12.290 --> 10:13.210
...can't.

10:16.340 --> 10:19.160
Look. I brought this from your home.

10:20.760 --> 10:21.720
I can't look.

10:23.140 --> 10:26.309
You can't look.
Can't stand. Can't fight.

10:26.310 --> 10:27.730
Have you no balls?

10:28.230 --> 10:30.080
Did Marley castrate you?

10:30.600 --> 10:33.860
It's pointless to try and
make me recall my hatred.

10:34.900 --> 10:36.550
All I have left now...

10:38.400 --> 10:39.570
...are my sins.

10:40.490 --> 10:42.240
That's more than enough.

10:43.870 --> 10:49.120
The main reason I picked you was
because you left the walls that day.

10:50.370 --> 10:54.210
That day, if you hadn't taken your
little sister and gone past the walls,

10:54.880 --> 10:57.589
you would've taken over
your father's clinic,

10:57.590 --> 11:02.050
your sister may have grown up,
married, and even had children.

11:02.680 --> 11:05.250
But you did go outside the walls.

11:06.430 --> 11:09.780
Ever since the first day I kicked
a patriot off this wall...

11:10.390 --> 11:13.580
Ever since that day you took
your sister outside the walls...

11:14.020 --> 11:17.860
We must push forward until
the price of our actions is paid.

11:18.440 --> 11:21.070
Even in death and after death.

11:26.410 --> 11:27.240
This is...

11:29.200 --> 11:31.830
...a story that you began, is it not?

11:44.050 --> 11:47.640
There are names given
to each of the Nine Titans.

11:48.310 --> 11:51.310
That includes the
Titan you will inherit.

11:52.480 --> 11:56.270
No matter which era this
Titan has found itself in,

11:56.820 --> 12:00.070
it has pushed ever forward,
seeking out freedom.

12:00.900 --> 12:03.540
For the sake of freedom, it fights.

12:05.950 --> 12:06.700
Its name...

12:07.830 --> 12:09.580
The Attack Titan.

12:18.550 --> 12:19.590
What are you doing?

12:23.760 --> 12:25.300
The Attack Titan.

12:25.930 --> 12:27.420
Didn't you just do that?

12:28.100 --> 12:28.640
No.

12:28.890 --> 12:33.389
Huh?! He did that, right?
Didn't you two see it just now?

12:33.390 --> 12:35.520
Yeah, but that was...

12:35.770 --> 12:38.649
See?! What was that all about, Eren?

12:38.650 --> 12:39.980
No, it's nothing.

12:40.350 --> 12:44.709
It's the name of your Titan, isn't it?
What were you doing talking to yourself?

12:44.710 --> 12:47.779
Enough, Hange. He's 15 years old.

12:47.780 --> 12:49.660
Everyone goes through a phase.

12:49.740 --> 12:51.909
Huh? What kind of phase
are we talking about?

12:51.910 --> 12:55.919
Hange, I'll explain to you later.
It's not right with him here.

12:55.920 --> 12:58.169
Huh? What do you mean by that?

12:58.170 --> 13:00.050
What the hell did you come for?!

13:01.090 --> 13:01.550
Get out.

13:02.720 --> 13:05.550
I'm supposed to be disciplined
for ten more days.

13:06.010 --> 13:06.800
It's over.

13:07.510 --> 13:10.060
Hange just now was punishment enough.

13:10.390 --> 13:13.769
We had a talk with Premier Zachary,
so don't worry about it.

13:13.770 --> 13:17.269
If we jail the heroes who toppled
the Armored and Colossal Titan,

13:17.270 --> 13:19.820
it kinda sends a bad message, you know?

13:20.020 --> 13:25.399
Plus, you were defying us morons who let
the Beast and Armored Titan get away.

13:25.400 --> 13:26.450
That's not...

13:30.530 --> 13:32.170
Did you lose some weight?

13:33.120 --> 13:34.960
We had plenty to eat, though.

13:39.380 --> 13:41.460
You seem... good.

13:41.880 --> 13:42.919
I guess...

13:42.920 --> 13:45.130
Let's go. Get dressed quick.

13:45.970 --> 13:47.180
Where are we going?

13:47.930 --> 13:48.930
To an audience.

13:49.550 --> 13:51.780
Her Majesty has come to Trost.

13:59.100 --> 14:00.950
To my dear Historia...

14:01.440 --> 14:04.440
As I'm writing this,
Reiner stands next to me.

14:05.190 --> 14:08.630
It's pretty obvious that he's
sneaking peeks at this love letter.

14:08.950 --> 14:11.870
He can be such a creep.
No wonder he's single.

14:12.950 --> 14:17.210
However, he did promise me
he'd deliver this letter to you.

14:18.540 --> 14:21.790
He says it's payback for
saving them that one time.

14:23.670 --> 14:25.210
I'm sorry about then.

14:25.670 --> 14:29.830
I never imagined I would end up
choosing them over you.

14:31.470 --> 14:33.200
It won't be long till I die.

14:33.680 --> 14:35.850
But I have no regrets.

14:36.730 --> 14:40.380
That's what I'd like to say,
but there is one thing...

14:41.270 --> 14:43.660
It's that I wasn't able to marry you.

14:44.650 --> 14:45.730
Sincerely, Ymir.

15:01.130 --> 15:05.190
All the paths cross at
a single coordinate.

15:06.340 --> 15:08.610
In other words, that's...

15:09.220 --> 15:10.790
...the Founding Titan.

15:13.510 --> 15:15.230
What... was that?

15:19.140 --> 15:20.189
Something wrong?

15:20.190 --> 15:21.480
Uh, no...

15:23.730 --> 15:25.150
Is that all there was?

15:25.440 --> 15:26.120
Yes.

15:26.690 --> 15:30.970
Of course, I doubt she was able
to write anything beneficial for us.

15:31.570 --> 15:34.560
Was there any secret message
only you would know?

15:35.160 --> 15:35.910
Like a code?

15:37.200 --> 15:38.200
I don't know.

15:38.950 --> 15:41.310
But I doubt she would
do something like that.

15:44.840 --> 15:46.770
Ymir's such a dummy...

15:47.710 --> 15:48.880
Such a dummy.

15:50.670 --> 15:53.050
You'd play it off the second
you're embarrassed...

15:54.220 --> 15:55.930
I just never know with you...

15:58.600 --> 15:59.400
We're here.

15:59.730 --> 16:00.390
Come in.

16:08.610 --> 16:09.430
Your Majesty.

16:09.780 --> 16:10.939
...Your Majesty.
...Your Majesty.

16:10.940 --> 16:14.300
S-Stop it.
It's not an official position yet.

16:16.990 --> 16:19.350
So much has happened, hasn't it?

16:20.290 --> 16:23.930
But all I did was stare at the
south sky from within the walls.

16:24.540 --> 16:27.669
It's an important duty of yours
just to stay alive.

16:27.670 --> 16:28.930
Yeah, that's right.

16:30.050 --> 16:33.050
I'm glad to see you're
all acting like usual.

16:34.760 --> 16:35.750
Well, that's...

16:36.220 --> 16:38.810
It just hasn't sunk in for us yet.

16:39.720 --> 16:41.060
Shall we get this going?

16:45.560 --> 16:47.750
The Early Life of Grisha Yeager.

16:48.110 --> 16:50.570
The Extent of Our Knowledge
of Titans and Their History.

16:51.070 --> 16:52.940
Information About the
World Beyond the Walls.

16:53.280 --> 16:56.369
The only people who know about
the existence of these books

16:56.370 --> 16:58.760
are those here in this very room.

16:59.740 --> 17:02.430
These were gained by the
efforts of nine living Scouts...

17:02.710 --> 17:06.330
...and the 199 others
who are not here today.

17:06.960 --> 17:11.590
Today, and in the Queen's presence,
I would like to assess our situation...

17:11.880 --> 17:15.420
...and establish an agreement
in terms of our course of action.

17:17.300 --> 17:20.099
Scout Regiment Commander Hange Zoë.

17:20.100 --> 17:21.180
Sir.

17:22.390 --> 17:26.269
The Scouts have lost a great
deal, including Erwin Smith.

17:26.270 --> 17:29.110
But in exchange for the
many heroes that we lost,

17:29.400 --> 17:34.860
we have retaken Wall Maria and
stolen the Colossal Titan's powers.

17:35.150 --> 17:40.780
However, humanity that lives within the
walls remains in a precarious situation.

17:41.450 --> 17:45.680
It would be a relief were Titans
the only monsters we had for enemies.

17:46.250 --> 17:49.480
...However, the true identity of
the enemies we've been fighting

17:49.481 --> 17:50.670
...Then who's the enemy?!

17:50.670 --> 17:52.799
...Enemy?

17:50.671 --> 17:53.960
...are humans. A civilization.
You could even say...

17:52.800 --> 17:53.959
...If I said that, the...

17:53.960 --> 17:55.550
......the world.

17:57.590 --> 17:58.889
According to these,

17:58.890 --> 18:03.020
we're a special race called Subjects
of Ymir who can turn into Titans.

18:03.520 --> 18:06.430
There's also a belief that we
may rule the world again.

18:07.020 --> 18:12.060
That's why the world wishes to
eradicate us Subjects of Ymir for good.

18:15.900 --> 18:20.710
If the Founding Titan falls into
Marley hands, Eldians are done for.

18:22.240 --> 18:25.130
The King in the walls wouldn't
allow that to happen.

18:25.750 --> 18:27.749
The King in the walls won't fight.

18:27.750 --> 18:28.250
Huh?

18:29.750 --> 18:35.480
"If once again Eldia is driven to sin,
we will perish as it's meant to be.

18:35.920 --> 18:39.570
I have made a vow renouncing war
with the Founding Titan."

18:40.140 --> 18:45.100
He said that to the royal family on the
continent and then closed the walls.

18:46.810 --> 18:51.750
Did he not warn that the Titans of
the walls would flatten the earth?

18:52.270 --> 18:55.110
Those words were meant
to deter an attack.

18:55.190 --> 18:57.850
It allowed for a brief time of peace.

18:59.860 --> 19:02.619
The King of the walls stole
his people's memories

19:02.620 --> 19:05.540
and made them believe humanity
perished beyond the walls.

19:06.290 --> 19:10.750
He surrounded himself with the ignorant
and babbled about paradise.

19:11.670 --> 19:14.540
A King who can't protect
his people is no King.

19:14.920 --> 19:19.590
You must find that cowardly King
and strip him of the Founding Titan.

19:20.090 --> 19:22.220
That is our mission.

19:24.050 --> 19:26.929
Mr. Jaeger later achieved his mission

19:26.930 --> 19:29.940
and entrusted the Founding
Titan to his son Eren.

19:31.020 --> 19:34.269
In order to wield the
Founding Titan's full power,

19:34.270 --> 19:37.650
it must be possessed by
someone with royal blood.

19:38.530 --> 19:42.199
However, even if that person
possesses the Founding Titan,

19:42.200 --> 19:44.529
they're enslaved by the King's ideals,

19:44.530 --> 19:47.910
which only leads them down
the path to humanity's downfall.

19:48.830 --> 19:51.750
That is the vow renouncing war.

19:53.290 --> 19:57.215
However, Eren was able
to control Pure Titans

19:57.240 --> 19:59.404
in the past to escape
a dire situation.

20:00.550 --> 20:03.259
So it may be possible even
without royal blood

20:03.260 --> 20:06.870
for Eren to wield that power as well.

20:07.640 --> 20:08.720
That's right...

20:10.020 --> 20:13.950
Just for that split second,
it felt like everything connected.

20:15.650 --> 20:16.400
Why?

20:17.940 --> 20:19.440
Why just then?

20:22.820 --> 20:25.200
My name is Dina Fritz.

20:25.570 --> 20:27.950
I'm a descendant of the royal family.

20:28.330 --> 20:29.370
It can't be!

20:32.410 --> 20:35.329
You scared me. What was that about?

20:35.330 --> 20:36.710
U-Uh... I-I...

20:41.670 --> 20:44.220
Please continue, our Titan.

20:49.140 --> 20:50.639
It's... nothing.

20:50.640 --> 20:51.410
Huh?

20:52.940 --> 20:54.730
Sorry for interrupting the meeting.

21:00.070 --> 21:03.610
Oh? I see... Right...

21:05.660 --> 21:09.119
It would seem that he is
having a phase of sorts.

21:09.120 --> 21:12.410
One where he acts up
and randomly yells things.

21:12.710 --> 21:15.810
Ah, I see. That's unfortunate.

21:16.080 --> 21:17.670
He's that age, I guess.

21:18.210 --> 21:18.970
Eren?

21:19.840 --> 21:22.670
I haven't told those two about
it, either...

21:23.420 --> 21:26.389
That the Titan who
killed my mom and Hannes

21:26.390 --> 21:29.360
was actually someone my dad
was married to before.

21:31.060 --> 21:34.300
What's more, if I talk about it...

21:36.020 --> 21:39.729
If someone with royal blood
is made into a Titan that I touch,

21:39.730 --> 21:43.460
it might be possible for me to use
the Founding Titan's powers.

21:44.320 --> 21:46.910
That's right...
It's just a possibility...

21:47.740 --> 21:52.910
But if they knew of that possibility,
what would the military do to Historia?

22:00.130 --> 22:01.460
Have a family.

22:02.000 --> 22:02.920
Huh?

22:02.921 --> 22:05.759
After you enter the
walls, build a family.

22:05.760 --> 22:08.940
What are you talking about?
I have Dina...

22:09.510 --> 22:14.479
Won't I forget the things you tell me
just before I become a Titan anyways?

22:14.480 --> 22:16.120
That's not always the case.

22:16.440 --> 22:18.769
And someone may see it later.

22:18.770 --> 22:19.230
Eh?

22:19.560 --> 22:22.610
Your wife, your child,
your neighbors if need be...

22:23.030 --> 22:24.970
Love someone inside the walls.

22:27.530 --> 22:30.449
If you can't do that, it'll only repeat.

22:30.450 --> 22:34.750
The same history... The same
mistakes... Over and over...

22:35.410 --> 22:40.250
To save Mikasa, Armin, and everyone
